    <cof:hasDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Benchmark for Brazilian natural-processed Arabica. Santos No. 4 is the standard export grade. Brazil's dominant commercial coffee price reference.</cof:hasDescription>
