    <cof:hasDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Principal harvest (cosecha principal) producing the majority of Colombian coffee. Wet-processed in small farms (fincas). FNC manages quality control through Almacafe.</cof:hasDescription>
  </rdf:Description>
