    <cof:hasDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Traditional espresso culture. Prefers dark roast, full body, persistent crema. Italian-style bars serving standing espresso. Lavazza, Illy, Segafredo are reference brands.</cof:hasDescription>
